  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stop Gender-Based Violence in Tajikistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP has been assisting the Government of Tajikistan to adopt policies and laws aimed at enhancing the role of women in Tajik society. UNDP has also been a partner for both the government and the civil society in building services for women and girls. This project will build on the lessons and experience of previous interventions and will work to prevent gender-based violence (GBV) and discrimination against women and girls in Tajikistan. The project will focus on enhancing the capacity of duty</narrative>
  </description>
